Copied once from that commit (design.md, decisions 7 and 22); later changes
from upstream are cherry-picked by hand. What came from where:

  upstream                       here
  src/client/**                  client/src/** (3D office, UI, models, sound, lab)
  src/client/index.html          client/index.html
  src/client/public/             client/public/
  src/client/models/*.glb        client/src/models/*.glb
  src/shared/** (incl. protocol) shared/src/office/**
  tests/*.test.ts, tests/glb.ts  client/test/ (only tests of kept client and
                                 shared code, moved from node:test to vitest)

Also taken from that commit, by hand (design.md, decision 22):

  src/server/limits.ts           bridge/src/live/limits.ts (Claude Code's
                                 get_usage control request and its parsing;
                                 Codex is read through codex app-server instead)

Not copied: the rest of the server (src/server), its agent providers, bin/, deploy/,
blender/ sources, install scripts and docs.

Changed here:
  - imports of src/shared point at @orca-office/shared/office/*;
  - features dropped by design.md decision 16 are removed: voice, accounts,
    login/claim/join pages, meetings, whiteboard (Excalidraw), queue, jukebox,
    cars, golf and the client side of the GitHub integration (the board
    windows and issue cards; the per-desk PR and issue windows stay), and
    with them the 2D /lite view, the board agents at the kiosks and the
    character select before entering;
  - the client talks to the orca-office bridge instead of the agent-office
    server, without a session or sign-in.
